WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.247
Hi! I'm Kate. Welcome to my house!

2
00:00:04.697 --> 00:00:07.669
I live in a house with my husband and my two daughters.

3
00:00:08.119 --> 00:00:13.924
This is the living room. It has a big sofa and a lot of cushions. I read here every night.

4
00:00:16.174 --> 00:00:20.029
This is the dining room. We have dinner here every day, at seven.

5
00:00:22.279 --> 00:00:27.805
And this is the kitchen. It has a stove, a fridge and a big oven.

6
00:00:28.255 --> 00:00:32.063
I love the oven! I make bread and cupcakes on Sundays.

7
00:00:34.313 --> 00:00:40.165
This is our bedroom. It has a bed, two pillows, a wardrobe

8
00:00:40.615 --> 00:00:43.308
and a bedside table with a lamp and a clock.

9
00:00:45.558 --> 00:00:50.574
And my favorite room? The bathroom! It has a big bathtub.

10
00:00:51.024 --> 00:00:52.928
I relax here on Saturdays.

11
00:00:55.178 --> 00:00:57.500
And you? What's your favorite room?

